			BrimflameEnchant: {
				DisplayName: Brimflame Enchantment
				Tooltip:
					'''
					[i:CalamityMod/BrimflameCowl] Grants an additional 15% increased damage and magic crit
					Press Armor Set Bonus to trigger a brimflame frenzy effect
					While under this effect, you get an additional 40% increase to magic damage
					However, this comes at the cost of rapid life loss and no mana regeneration
					This can be toggled off, however, a brimflame frenzy has a 30 second cooldown
					[i:CalamityMod/FlameLickedShell] 	Grants immunity to knockback
					Pressing Activate Accessory Parry will activate a parry, encasing you in rocks
					Being hit shortly after encasement will implode the rocks
					Upon implosion, a ring of brimstone hellfire is launched outwards and you receive 90% DR for that hit
					After imploding, this damage reduction effect goes on cooldown
					Damage parried whilst on cooldown summons weaker brimstone flames, and will not be reduced
					[i:CalamityMod/Abaddon] 8% increased critical strike chance
					Critical strikes explode, igniting nearby foes with [cbuff:CalamityMod/BrimstoneFlames]
					Reduces damage taken from [cbuff:CalamityMod/BrimstoneFlames] by 50%
					[i:CalamityMod/SlagsplitterPauldron] Your dashes become empowered by flame, erupting on contact with enemies
					Grants immunity to knockback and 10% damage reduction while dashing
					Enemies hit by your dashes have their armor crushed
					Visual effects are reduced if visibility is disabled
					[i:CalamityMod/VoidofCalamity] 12% increased damage
					Brimstone fire rains down after getting hit
					[i:CalamityMod/SigilofCalamitas] 15% increased magic damage and 10% decreased mana usage
					+100 max mana
					Increases pickup range for mana stars
					'''
			}

