			FathomSwarmerEnchant: {
				DisplayName: Fathom Swarmer Enchantment
				Tooltip:
					'''
					[i:CalamityMod/FathomSwarmerVisage] 10% increased summon damage and +2 max minions
					Grants the ability to climb walls
					20% increased summon damage, +10 defense and +2.5 HP/s life regen while underwater
					Provides a moderate amount of light and moderately reduces breath loss in the abyss
					[i:CalamityMod/CorrosiveSpine] 	5% increased movement speed
					25% increased Sickness and Water debuff damage
					All attacks irradiate enemies and reduces the severity of the sulphuric waters
					You burst into radioactive clouds when struck
					[i:CalamityMod/DiamondOfTheDeep] 60% increased Water debuff damage
					Slowly accrue up to three different abyssal spirits
					Dash to disperse the spirits and have them attack enemies
					When dispersed [c/CB7AD7:below 50% life], the spirits support you instead
					The spirits appear in order and have different effects based on color:
					[c/3CB371: Explodes on impact and inflicts Crush Depth] / [c/CB7AD7:Heals for 8 HP]
					[c/FF4500: Pierces enemies and inflicts Hellfire] / [c/CB7AD7:Increases defense by 10 temporarily]
					[c/1E90FF: Hits multiple times and inflicts Hadopelagic Pressure] / [c/CB7AD7:Heals 5% of max HP]
					Spirits are transparent and silent when visibility is toggled off
					'Just keep on swimming down and down'
					'''
			}

			FearfallenEnchant: {
				DisplayName: Fearfallen Enchantment
				Tooltip:
					'''
					[i:CalamityMod/FearmongerGreathelm] 20% increased summon damage and +2 max minions
					Minions no longer deal less damage while wielding non-summoner weapons
					Immunity to all forms of frost and flame
					Minion attacks grant +3.5 HP/s life regen and massively accelerate life regen
					15% increased damage reduction during the Pumpkin and Frost Moons
