					Xx If you have Ragnarok Installed xX
					[i:RagnarokMod/NightfallenHelmet] 35% decreased non-radiant damage
					35% increased radiant damage and 16% increased criticial radiant strike chance
					Healing spells will heal an additional 1 life
					Maximum mana increased by 60
					Xx If you have Ragnarok Installed xX
					[i:CalamityMod/SpectralVeil] Pressing Spectral Veil Teleport consumes 25% of your maximum stealth to teleport, rendering you invulnerable
					If you dodge something while invulnerable, you instantly gain full stealth
					Teleportation is disabled while Chaos State is active
					Stealth generates 15% faster
					'Your enemies shall fall to their fear'
