			PlaguebringerEnchant: {
				DisplayName: Plaguebringer Enchantment
				Tooltip:
					'''
					[i:CalamityMod/PlaguebringerVisor] Grants a plague dash which can slam through enemies without taking damage
					Summons a lil' plaguebringer which swarms your foes with little bees
					+3 max minions
					[i:CalamityMod/TheBee] When at full HP, your damage is increased based on your damage reduction
