					[i:gcsep/AstralEnchant] Effects of Interstellar Stompers, Ursa Sergeant, and Astral Armor
					[i:gcsep/UmbraphileEnchant] Effects of Vampiric Talisman, Coin of Deceit, and Umbraphile Hood
					[i:gcsep/FathomSwarmerEnchant] Effects of Diamond of the Deep, Corrosive Spine, and Fathom Swarmer Visage
					[i:gcsep/MolluskEnchant] Effects of Giant Pearl, Aquatic Emblem, and Mollusk Shell Armor
					[i:gcsep/OmegaBlueEnchant] Effects of Old Duke Scales, Reaper Tooth Necklace, and Omega Blue Armor
					[i:gcsep/OmegaBlueEnchant] Summons a [cbuff:CalamityMod/MutatedTruffleBuff] to fight for you
					'''
			}

